{
  "$schema": "../recommender.schema.json",
  "title": {
    "hu": "E-bike ajánló",
    "en": "E-bike finder"
  },
  "intro": {
    "hu": "Nem kell adatlapokat böngészned: válaszolj néhány kérdésre, és mi minden e-bike-ot a te igényeidhez mérünk. Azonnal látod, melyik illik hozzád a legjobban, és miért.",
    "en": "No need to browse spec sheets: answer a few questions and we measure every e-bike against what you need. You see at once which one suits you best, and why."
  },
  "search": {
    "minResults": 12,
    "maxResults": 60,
    "unknownScore": 0.4
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "usage",
      "type": "multi",
      "maxChoices": 2,
      "question": {
        "hu": "Mire használnád leginkább?",
        "en": "What will you mostly ride it for?"
      },
      "help": {
        "hu": "Ez a legfontosabb döntés: a kerékpár jellege igazodjon ahhoz, ahol használni fogod. Ha a mostani bringádat hasonló célra használod, érdemes abból kiindulni.",
        "en": "This matters most: the kind of bike should match where you will ride it. If you ride your current bike for the same purpose, start from that."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "commute",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Városi közlekedés, munkába járás",
            "en": "Commuting in town"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "usageType",
              "in": ["City", "Trekking"],
              "partial": {
                "Cross Trekking": 0.6
              },
              "importance": "high"
            },
            {
              "spec": "lighting",
              "in": ["Alapfelszereltség"],
              "importance": "low"
            },
            {
              "spec": "fenders",
              "in": ["Alapfelszereltség"],
              "importance": "low"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "tour",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Túrázás aszfalton, murván",
            "en": "Touring on asphalt and gravel paths"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "usageType",
              "in": ["Trekking", "Cross Trekking"],
              "partial": {
                "City": 0.5
              },
              "importance": "high"
            },
            {
              "spec": "rack",
              "in": ["Alapfelszereltség"],
              "importance": "low"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "trail",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Erdei, mezei utak, könnyű terep",
            "en": "Forest and field tracks, light off-road"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "usageType",
              "in": ["Cross Trekking", "MTB"],
              "partial": {
                "Trekking": 0.5,
                "Gravel": 0.5
              },
              "importance": "high"
            },
            {
              "spec": "suspension",
              "in": ["Első teleszkóp", "Első teleszkóp, hátsó rugóstag"],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "mountain",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Hegyi terep, single trail",
            "en": "Mountain trails"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "usageType",
              "in": ["MTB", "Összteleszkópos MTB"],
              "importance": "high"
            },
            {
              "spec": "motorPosition",
              "in": ["Középmotor"],
              "importance": "medium"
            },
            {
              "spec": "torque",
              "gte": 75,
              "tolerance": 0.15,
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sport",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Sportos tekerés országúton, gravelen",
            "en": "Sporty riding on road or gravel"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "usageType",
              "in": ["Gravel", "Országúti", "Cyclocross", "Fitness"],
              "importance": "high"
            },
            {
              "spec": "weight",
              "lte": 20,
              "tolerance": 0.15,
              "importance": "low"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cargo",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Teher vagy gyerek szállítása",
            "en": "Carrying cargo or children"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "usageType",
              "in": ["Cargo"],
              "importance": "high"
            },
            {
              "spec": "torque",
              "gte": 75,
              "tolerance": 0.15,
              "importance": "medium"
            },
            {
              "spec": "maxTotalWeight",
              "gte": 180,
              "tolerance": 0.15,
              "importance": "low"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "folding",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Utazás, kis helyen tárolás",
            "en": "Travel, storing in a small space"
          },
          "help": {
            "hu": "Összecsukható kerékpár",
            "en": "A folding bike"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "usageType",
              "in": ["Összecsukható"],
              "importance": "high"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "terrain",
      "type": "single",
      "question": {
        "hu": "Milyen terepen tekersz, mennyi emelkedővel?",
        "en": "What terrain do you ride, how hilly is it?"
      },
      "help": {
        "hu": "Emelkedőn a motor nyomatéka számít: nagyjából 30 Nm gyenge, 40–50 Nm átlagos, 60 Nm felett erős. Meredek, hosszú emelkedőkhöz erősebb középmotort keresünk.",
        "en": "On climbs the torque of the motor counts: about 30 Nm is weak, 40–50 Nm average, over 60 Nm strong. For long, steep climbs we look for a stronger mid-drive motor."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "flat",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Főleg sík",
            "en": "Mostly flat"
          },
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "noneOf": ["mountain"]
            }
          ],
          "values": {
            "whPerKm": 6
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "hilly",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Dombos, néhány emelkedővel",
            "en": "Rolling, some climbs"
          },
          "values": {
            "whPerKm": 9
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "torque",
              "gte": 50,
              "tolerance": 0.15,
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "steep",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Meredek, hosszú emelkedők",
            "en": "Steep, long climbs"
          },
          "values": {
            "whPerKm": 12
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "torque",
              "gte": 65,
              "tolerance": 0.15,
              "importance": "medium"
            },
            {
              "spec": "motorPosition",
              "in": ["Középmotor"],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "distance",
      "type": "single",
      "showIf": [
        {
          "step": "usage",
          "noneOf": ["folding"]
        }
      ],
      "question": {
        "hu": "Milyen hosszú egy tipikus utad?",
        "en": "How long is a typical ride?"
      },
      "help": {
        "hu": "A gyári hatótávot kedvező körülmények között mérik. Az utad hosszára rászámolunk 30–40% tartalékot, és ebből becsüljük a szükséges akkumulátor-kapacitást.",
        "en": "Factory range is measured in ideal conditions. We add a 30–40% reserve to your ride and estimate the battery capacity you need from that."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "upTo20",
          "label": {
            "hu": "20 km-ig",
            "en": "Up to 20 km"
          },
          "values": {
            "km": 20
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "upTo40",
          "label": {
            "hu": "20–40 km",
            "en": "20–40 km"
          },
          "values": {
            "km": 40
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "upTo70",
          "label": {
            "hu": "40–70 km",
            "en": "40–70 km"
          },
          "values": {
            "km": 70
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "over70",
          "label": {
            "hu": "70 km felett",
            "en": "Over 70 km"
          },
          "values": {
            "km": 100
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "speed",
      "type": "single",
      "default": "pedelec",
      "question": {
        "hu": "Milyen gyorsan szeretnél haladni rásegítéssel?",
        "en": "How fast should the motor help you go?"
      },
      "help": {
        "hu": "A pedelec 25 km/h-ig segít, és kerékpárnak számít. A 45 km/h-s S-pedelec segédmotoros kerékpár: jogosítvány, biztosítás és bukósisak kell hozzá, és jóval drágább.",
        "en": "A pedelec assists up to 25 km/h and counts as a bicycle. A 45 km/h S-pedelec is a moped: it needs a licence, insurance and a helmet, and costs much more."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "pedelec",
          "label": {
            "hu": "25 km/h-ig (pedelec)",
            "en": "Up to 25 km/h (pedelec)"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "pedelecClass",
              "in": ["Pedelec"],
              "importance": "high",
              "assumeWhenMissing": "Pedelec"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "speed",
          "label": {
            "hu": "45 km/h-ig (S-pedelec)",
            "en": "Up to 45 km/h (S-pedelec)"
          },
          "help": {
            "hu": "Jogosítvány, biztosítás és bukósisak kell hozzá.",
            "en": "Needs a licence, insurance and a helmet."
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "pedelecClass",
              "in": ["S-Pedelec"],
              "importance": "high"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "height",
      "type": "number",
      "question": {
        "hu": "Milyen magas vagy?",
        "en": "How tall are you?"
      },
      "help": {
        "hu": "A testmagasságodból becsüljük a vázméretet (MTB-nél ugyanahhoz a magassághoz kisebb váz illik), és előre soroljuk azokat a kerékpárokat, amelyek a te méretedben kaphatók.",
        "en": "We estimate the frame size from your height (an MTB frame runs smaller for the same height) and rank the bikes available in your size first."
      },
      "number": {
        "min": 140,
        "max": 210,
        "step": 1,
        "initial": 175,
        "unit": {
          "hu": "cm",
          "en": "cm"
        }
      },
      "bands": [
        {
          "min": 140,
          "max": 160,
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "anyOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "spec": "frameSize",
                  "between": [36, 40]
                },
                {
                  "spec": "frameSizeLabel",
                  "in": ["XS", "S"]
                }
              ],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "min": 160,
          "max": 170,
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "anyOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "spec": "frameSize",
                  "between": [39, 44]
                },
                {
                  "spec": "frameSizeLabel",
                  "in": ["S", "M"]
                }
              ],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "min": 170,
          "max": 180,
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "anyOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "spec": "frameSize",
                  "between": [43, 48]
                },
                {
                  "spec": "frameSizeLabel",
                  "in": ["M", "L"]
                }
              ],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "min": 180,
          "max": 190,
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "anyOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "spec": "frameSize",
                  "between": [47, 52]
                },
                {
                  "spec": "frameSizeLabel",
                  "in": ["L", "XL"]
                }
              ],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "min": 190,
          "max": 211,
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "anyOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "spec": "frameSize",
                  "between": [51, 56]
                },
                {
                  "spec": "frameSizeLabel",
                  "in": ["XL", "XXL"]
                }
              ],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "min": 140,
          "max": 160,
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "noneOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "spec": "frameSize",
                  "between": [41, 46]
                },
                {
                  "spec": "frameSizeLabel",
                  "in": ["XS", "S"]
                }
              ],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "min": 160,
          "max": 170,
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "noneOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "spec": "frameSize",
                  "between": [45, 50]
                },
                {
                  "spec": "frameSizeLabel",
                  "in": ["S", "M"]
                }
              ],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "min": 170,
          "max": 180,
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "noneOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "spec": "frameSize",
                  "between": [49, 54]
                },
                {
                  "spec": "frameSizeLabel",
                  "in": ["M", "L"]
                }
              ],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "min": 180,
          "max": 190,
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "noneOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "spec": "frameSize",
                  "between": [53, 58]
                },
                {
                  "spec": "frameSizeLabel",
                  "in": ["L", "XL"]
                }
              ],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "min": 190,
          "max": 211,
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "noneOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "spec": "frameSize",
                  "between": [57, 64]
                },
                {
                  "spec": "frameSizeLabel",
                  "in": ["XL", "XXL"]
                }
              ],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "weight",
      "type": "single",
      "optional": true,
      "question": {
        "hu": "Mekkora a testsúlyod (csomaggal együtt)?",
        "en": "What do you weigh (with luggage)?"
      },
      "help": {
        "hu": "Nagyobb terheléshez több akkumulátor-kapacitás és erősebb motor kell, és a kerékpár megengedett össztömegére is figyelünk.",
        "en": "A heavier load needs more battery capacity and a stronger motor, and we check the maximum total weight of the bike."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "upTo85",
          "label": {
            "hu": "85 kg-ig",
            "en": "Up to 85 kg"
          },
          "values": {
            "whFactor": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "upTo110",
          "label": {
            "hu": "85–110 kg",
            "en": "85–110 kg"
          },
          "values": {
            "whFactor": 1.1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "over110",
          "label": {
            "hu": "110 kg felett",
            "en": "Over 110 kg"
          },
          "values": {
            "whFactor": 1.2
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "torque",
              "gte": 65,
              "tolerance": 0.15,
              "importance": "medium"
            },
            {
              "spec": "maxTotalWeight",
              "gte": 140,
              "tolerance": 0.1,
              "importance": "low"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "frame",
      "type": "single",
      "question": {
        "hu": "Milyen vázat szeretnél?",
        "en": "What kind of frame do you want?"
      },
      "help": {
        "hu": "Az alacsony belépésű váz kényelmes fel- és leszállást ad, például városban vagy ha nehezebb átlendíteni a lábad.",
        "en": "A low step-through frame makes getting on and off easy, for example in town or if swinging a leg over is hard."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "easy",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Könnyű fel- és leszállás (alacsony váz)",
            "en": "Easy on and off (step-through)"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "frameType",
              "in": ["Alacsony"],
              "partial": {
                "Trapéz": 0.5
              },
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "classic",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Hagyományos váz",
            "en": "Classic frame"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "frameType",
              "in": ["Magas", "Trapéz"],
              "importance": "low"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mustHaves",
      "type": "multi",
      "optional": true,
      "question": {
        "hu": "Mi legyen benne mindenképp?",
        "en": "What must it have?"
      },
      "help": {
        "hu": "Csak azt jelöld meg, amiről nem mondanál le: minden extra szűkíti a kínálatot.",
        "en": "Only pick what you would not do without: every extra narrows the choice."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "removable",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Kivehető akkumulátor",
            "en": "Removable battery"
          },
          "help": {
            "hu": "Lakásban is tölthető",
            "en": "Charge it indoors"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "batteryRemovable",
              "is": true,
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cityKit",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Teljes városi felszereltség",
            "en": "Full city equipment"
          },
          "help": {
            "hu": "Lámpa, sárvédő, csomagtartó, kitámasztó",
            "en": "Lights, fenders, rack, kickstand"
          },
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "noneOf": ["sport", "mountain"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "lighting",
              "in": ["Alapfelszereltség"],
              "importance": "low"
            },
            {
              "spec": "fenders",
              "in": ["Alapfelszereltség"],
              "importance": "low"
            },
            {
              "spec": "rack",
              "in": ["Alapfelszereltség"],
              "importance": "low"
            },
            {
              "spec": "kickstand",
              "is": true,
              "importance": "low"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "suspension",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Teleszkópos villa",
            "en": "Suspension fork"
          },
          "showIf": [
            {
              "step": "usage",
              "noneOf": ["mountain", "trail"]
            }
          ],
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "suspension",
              "in": ["Első teleszkóp", "Első teleszkóp, hátsó rugóstag"],
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "abs",
          "label": {
            "hu": "ABS",
            "en": "ABS"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "abs",
              "is": true,
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "smart",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Okos rendszer, telefonos app",
            "en": "Smart system, phone app"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "smartConnectivity",
              "is": true,
              "importance": "low"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "light",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Könnyű, 23 kg alatt",
            "en": "Light, under 23 kg"
          },
          "help": {
            "hu": "Lépcsőn, autóra emelve is kezelhető",
            "en": "Easier to carry upstairs or onto a car"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "weight",
              "lte": 23,
              "tolerance": 0.1,
              "importance": "medium"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "motor",
      "type": "multi",
      "optional": true,
      "question": {
        "hu": "Van kedvenc motorrendszered?",
        "en": "Do you have a favourite motor system?"
      },
      "help": {
        "hu": "Sokan a motor alapján választanak e-bike-ot. A nagy gyártók rendszerei mind megbízhatóak, ez inkább ízlés kérdése.",
        "en": "Many people choose an e-bike by its motor. The systems of the big makers are all reliable; it is mostly a matter of taste."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "bosch",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Bosch",
            "en": "Bosch"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "motorBrand",
              "in": ["Bosch"],
              "importance": "low"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "shimano",
          "label": {
            "hu": "Shimano",
            "en": "Shimano"
          },
          "set": [
            {
              "spec": "motorBrand",
              "in": ["Shimano"],
              "importance": "low"
            }
